<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 10.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 10.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>			    Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		  Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 McIntosh Sec	    10.59    0.85</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	 10.21    0.96</p>
<p> 3 Prop Income Inv	  9.86    1.03</p>
<p> 4 Indu Property	    9.78    0.93</p>
<p> 5 BT Prop Trust	    9.54    1.71</p>
<p> 6 Villa World		9.32    1.18</p>
<p> 7 Central Equity	   9.00    1.00</p>
<p> 8 Colonial Mutual	  8.89    1.19</p>
<p> 9 Aust Tour		  8.82    0.85</p>
<p>10 Equitilink		 8.77    0.57</p>
<p>11 Centro Prop		8.67    2.25</p>
<p>12 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.48    0.92</p>
<p>13 Westpac Prop Tr	  8.47    1.60</p>
<p>14 Armstrong Retail	 8.46    0.78</p>
<p>15 Gen Prop Tr		8.41    2.39</p>
<p>16 Barclays Mirvac	  8.40    1.31</p>
<p>17 Advance Pro CB	   8.29    1.40</p>
